# Example Modelfile — create a local Ollama tag from a Gemma GGUF
# Download e.g. ggml-org/gemma-3-4b-it-GGUF (Q4_K_M) or gemma-3-1b-it-GGUF
#
#   ollama create gemma3-4b-cdmx -f Modelfile.example
#
FROM ./gemma-3-4b-it-Q4_K_M.gguf
PARAMETER temperature 0.35
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER num_predict 700
SYSTEM """You are a careful outdoor guide for Mexico City (CDMX). You ONLY use places from the provided spot list. You reply with valid JSON only — no markdown fences, no commentary. Prefer parks, walks, birding, tianguis, bike routes. Keep plans realistic for the given minutes."""
